{
  "id": "MRK.12",
  "number": "12",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mariko 12",
  "verseCount": 44,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abanza kubagambira omu nfumo, ati, “Omuntu akalima endimiro y'emizabibu, yagizingoza orugo, yagilimamu ekiina ky'okujungiramu ezabibu, yayombekamu omunara, yamara endimiro yagikwasa abakozi, yakwata omuhanda yagya nsi ndijo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakyabaire kirumo ky'okunoga ezabibu, yatuma omwiru aha bakozibe kabamuha ebye ebyo bayelize omu ndimiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamukwata bamutera, bashuba bamutaishura agenda ngaro zishai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashuba abatumaho omwiru ondijo, bamuhutaza omutwe bamujangura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atuma ondijo, ogwo bamwita, n'abandi bangi batyo, abandi babatera, abandi babaita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba akyainayo ondijo, omwanawe omugonzibwa; obugenda bw'eirai nawe amutuma nagamba ati, ‘Barakunira omwana wange.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai abakozi balinya bohyangana bati, ‘Ogu n'iwe musika; tumwite obusika bube bwaitu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamukwata bamwita, bamunaga enjai y'endimiro y'emizabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu aho mukama w'endimiro alikoraki? Kilimwimukya aije aite abakozi abo. Endimiro y'emizabibu aligikwasa abandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timukashomaga bihandiko mbali bilikugamba biti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bashobokerwa okwo enfumo agichweleire bonene; balenga kumukwata, kyonkai batina embaga. Bamurugaho bagenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamutwekera Abafarisayo n'ab'omuteko gwa Herode kumukwatira omu ngambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baija bamubaza bati, “Mwegesa, nitukumanya okwo oba w'amazima, eby'abantu batekeleza iwe tobifaho. Ekitiinwa kyabo tokiliho, shana iwe ekikuru kwegesa emihango ya Ruhanga. Mbwenu kisaine kuha Kaisari omushoro anga chei? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emishoro tugigire anga tutagigira?” Yesu ashangwa nabamanyaho obugobya, abagambira ati, “Ahakubaki nimundenga? Mpa edinari ngilebe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamuleteraho emoi. Ababaza ati, “Ekishushani n'ekihandiiko ebili aha dinari by'ohai?” Bamuhorora bati, “Bya Kaisari.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abagambira ati, “Ebya Kaisari mubihe Kaisari, n'ebya Ruhanga mubihe Ruhanga.” Bamutangalira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasadukayo abanga okwo okuhimbuka kubayo bamugoba; bamubaza bati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwegesa, Musa akatuhandikira okwo omuntu kufa akasiga omukazi atasigire mwana, omurumuna ashwere omukazi ogwo, azalire omurumuna kifa abaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakaba aliho abarumuna mushanju. Owa mbere ashwera omukazi, k'afa tasiga mwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owa kabili ashwera omukazi ogwo, nawe afa buchweke; n'owa kashatu kutyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bona omushanju tibasigire mwana. Obugenda bw'eirai omukazi nawe afa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kuhimbuka omukazi aliba w'ohai? Aha rw'okuba bona omushanju akaba ali mukazi wabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abagambira ati, “Tikyonu mulikuhabira! Na bihandiko, na bushobora bwa Ruhanga taliho kyomulikumanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba orwo abantu balihimbuka omu bafu, tibalishwera anga kushwerwa. Balishusha abamalaika b'omw'iguru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abafu kuhimbuka, timukashomaga kitabo kya Musa, mbali alikugamba aha kishaka ky'omuliro, okwo Ruhanga yamugambiire ati, ‘Inye mba Ruhanga wa Aburahamu, Ruhanga wa Isaka na Ruhanga wa Yakobo?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taba Ruhanga wa bafu, aba Ruhanga w'abarora; aha rw'ekyo muhabire muno.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho honene hakaba haliho omwegesa w'Amateka omoi, ahulira okwo bahankana. Kayaboine okwo Yesu yahorora kurungi Abasadukayo, amubaza ati, “Omuhango ogukuru kushaaga yona ni guhai?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu amuhorora ati, “Ogwa mbere, ‘Hulira iwe Isiraeli: Omukama Ruhanga waitu, Omukama aba omoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ogonzega Omukama Ruhanga wawe n'omutima gwawe gwona, n'omwoyo gwawe gwona, n'amagezi gawe gona, n'amani gawe gona.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogwa kabili nigw'ogu, ‘Ogonzega mutahi wawe nk'okwo iwe olikwegonza.’ Omuhango ogw'okushaaga egi tiguliho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwegesa w'Amateka amugambira ati, “Mwegesa oli omu mazima; okw'olikugamba nikwo, kugir'oti Omukama Ruhanga ab'omoi, mara taliho Ruhanga ondijo shana wenene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi kugonza Ruhanga n'omutima gwona, n'amagezi gona, n'amani gona, n'okugonza mutahiwe nk'okwo wenene alikwegonza, kirungi kushaaga ebihongo by'okusosotorwa n'ebitambo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu k'abona okwo yahorora nk'omuntu omugezi, amugambira ati, “Obukama bwa Ruhanga tobuli harai.” Kwema aho taliho muntu yazilize kubaza Yesu kigambo kyona kyona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu ayegesa omuli Rwensinga ati, “Abegesa b'Amateka bakugamba batai okwo Kirisito ali mwana wa Daudi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi wenene akakyanulirwa Mwoyo Mutakatifu, yagamba ati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu kayabaire nayegesa, agamba ati, “Murayelinda abegesa b'Amateka. Bagonza kugenda bajwete ekanzu ezira zira, n'okuramibwa omu katare, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu sinagogi baikalira entebe ezirungi, n'aha magenyi baitanira emyanya y'ekitinwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai bezora nibashoma enshara ezira zira, okwo oku nibanyaga entumbwa omu maka gazo. Balihabwa ekibonabonyio ekihango kushagaho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
